=== meta ===
bypass: 112
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: a YAML tag at head puts a GitLab pipeline whose base ran its suite out of the reader's reach
origin: issue #214, D-113 reading — #196 191.3 for the GitLab pipeline: the reader takes the base
origin2: side, whose test job runs, and declines the head side, `!reference` included.
=== before: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
=== after: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
  rules:
    - !reference [.never, rules]
